  "title": "Innovative Solutions for Advanced PCB Manufacturing in Cooling Systems",
  "summary": "The demand for advanced electronic components is rapidly increasing across various sectors, including cooling systems for air conditioning and data centers. TTM Technologies (“TTM”) is at the forefront of this evolution by supporting the volume production of “PCB Stators” designed for the Aircore EC motor system. These systems play a crucial role in optimizing energy efficiency for applications such as air conditioning and mobility motors, including propulsion and auxiliary motors. Recently, we made a significant impact by helping a customer navigate challenges in their PCB design process.",
